Adding Chord Diagrams (copy) - Manual
4/4

[Ex. 1 Love Me Tender /aura Lee Elvis] 1
| r1 |

vs 8
| !D / | E7 / | A7 / | !D / |
    | !D / | E7 / | A7 / | !D / |

ch 8
| !D_2 F#7/C#_2 | Bm_2 D7/A_2 | !G_2 Gm6_2 | !D / |
    | !D_2 B7_2 | E7 / | A7 / | ^"To show how to add chord diagrams, we'll use this well-known song." !D / |

